  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Under the sea, after Song Yi Shi’s stream veil drowns star snake rope, Fang Yuan finishes activating starlight Immortal Gu. Countless fire path mortal Gu surround it like fireflies. He casts the killer move and shoots upward. Song Yi Shi tries to obstruct him. An explosion wrecks the underwater volcano peak. The water is so deep that flying out of the sea surface still takes a good while. He uses the chase to blow the incident into a matter that can pressure him toward Zombie Alliance.",
      "chapters": [
        895
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_yi_shi",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_starlight_immortal_gu",
        "sys_mortal_gu",
        "fac_zombie_alliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The move was an incomplete concept left by predecessors in Star Lord Wan Xiang’s star path inheritance. They hit difficulties and could not finish it. Fang Yuan’s star path attainment is only ordinary, but with rank nine wisdom Gu he uses the light of wisdom for unlimited inspiration and forcefully completes it, together with projected star thought.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "gu_wisdom_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It becomes one of six star path immortal killer moves he controls, with star cloud grindstone, star snake rope, six illusion star bodies, and position star swap. Completing these two was his limit in the short time he had, because he holds only three star path Immortal Gu and his star path attainment is too low.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "incomplete-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In a gravity soil zone Fang Yuan lets himself slam into the wall, then activates the move. His body is covered in star fire and he flies, which draws a mouth earthworm out of the soil.",
      "chapters": [
        932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
